{{Illusionnotes
| name = Bladeform
| desc = The created [[illusion]] starts from a 0-stack Bladeform.
}}
{{Breaknotes
| name = Bladeform
| desc = Disables the buff stack gain.<br><br>However, existing stacks are not removed.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}}
** Grants a stack every {{#var:Bladeform value1}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Bladeform value1 tal}}|10tal}}) seconds up to the max stacks, over {{#expr:{{#var:Bladeform value2}}*{{#var:Bladeform value1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Bladeform value2}}*{{#var:Bladeform value1 tal}}}}|10tal}}) seconds, whenever Juggernaut does not take a damage instance.

* The ability effects are applied as follows upon taking a {{Code|< {{#var:Bladeform type1 value2}}-damage instance}} from all sources:
*# {{M|Dispels}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|juggernaut_bladeform}}.
*# Grants the lingering {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|juggernaut_bladeform_linger (x)}} corresponding to the current number of stacks.

* {{cf|expr}}
** Max {{M|agility}} bonus: {{Code|ΣCurrent[[Agility|Agi]] × f(Stack) × ({{#var:Bladeform value3}} + {{#var:Bladeform basic1}} × SelfLvl)}} 
** Max {{M|movement speed}} bonus: {{Code|f(Stack) × {{#var:Bladeform value4}}}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Bladeform icon0}}
| desc = Juggernaut gains a stack of Bladeform every 2s that Juggernaut does not take damage. Each stack grants bonus base Agility and Movement Speed. Stacks fade after 2s upon taking any damage.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The green ability particle effects on Juggernaut intensifies as the stack increases.

