fields.value:
{{Splblocknotes
| name = Omnislash
| desc = [[Spell Block]] sources procs on and blocks only the first damage instance.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Applies a {{M|basic dispel}} upon cast.
** Applies the following ability effects while active:
*** {{M|Disarm}}
*** {{M|Invulnerable}}
*** {{M|Phase movement}}
*** {{M|Root}}
*** {{M|Spell immune}}.
*** {{M|Untargetable}}
*** Can cast abilities, including item abilities, except {{A|Juggernaut|Blade Fury}}.
*** All Juggernaut's {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted abilities have an {{M|instant cast}} time and does not need to {{M|turn rate|text=turn}} to cast, within its {{M|cast range}}.
** Recasting Omnislash-based abilities while Omnislash is active cancels the previous cast and starts a new cast.

* {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
** Applies the following ability effects per instant attack applied:
*** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**** Grants a 1-second 200-radius [[flying vision]] centered on the affected enemy unit.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|l}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Juggernaut is always positioned at the opposite side of the affected enemy unit from his current position per instant attack instance, {{M|Facing Angle|text=facing}} the target.
** The [[instant attack]] damage interval is defined as:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|DmgInt {{=}} (100 × {{Show|H|Juggernaut|bat}}) / ([[Attack Speed|ΣAS]] × {{#var:Omnislash value2}}) + 1 [[Server Tick|ServerTick]]}}
*** With the {{M|attack speed}} limits, the min and max possible damage intervals are as follows:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|MIN {{=}} {{#expr:(100*{{Show|H|Juggernaut|bat}})/({{#var:Omnislash value2}}*{{G|attack speed max}}) round3}} + {{#expr:{{G|tick rate}} round3}}}}
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|MAX {{=}} {{#expr:(100*{{Show|H|Juggernaut|bat}})/({{#var:Omnislash value2}}*{{G|attack speed min}}) round3}} + {{#expr:{{G|tick rate}} round3}}}}
** Omnislash checks for Juggernaut's current {{M|attack speed}} per damage instance, then updates the damage intervals.
** The instant attacks applied has the following properties:
*** Grants flat {{M|bonus attack damage}} while Omnislash or {{A|Juggernaut|Swiftslash}} is active.
*** Proc {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal.
*** Does not have {{M|True Strike}}.
*** Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.

* {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}}
** The subsequent enemy unit search radius is centered around Juggernaut.
*** Does not search for the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers}}
**** {{M|Fogged units}}.
**** {{M|Hidden}} units.
**** {{M|Invisible}} units.
**** {{U|Undying Zombie|text=Undying Zombies}}.
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Omnislash icon0}}
| desc = Juggernaut leaps towards the target enemy units, and then slashes the target and other nearby enemy units at an increased attack rate. Juggernaut is invulnerable for the duration.
}}
* Centers the player's camera perspective on Juggernaut upon cast, following his position during Omnislash.

* Deals up to the following slash per 100 {{M|attack speed}} over the entire duration:
** {{#invoke:Lua|invoke|module=loop|fn=as|1|5|<nowiki>{{#expr:{{#var:as}}*100}} AS: {{calc|v1/((100*{{Show|H|Juggernaut|bat}})/({{#var:Omnislash value2}}*({{#var:as}}*100))+{{G|tick rate}}) round0|v1={{#var:Omnislash value6}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/((100*{{Show|H|Juggernaut|bat}})/({{#var:Omnislash value2}}*({{#var:as}}*100))+{{G|tick rate}}) round0|v1={{#var:Omnislash value6 tal}}}}|25tal}})
** </nowiki>}}

* While the ability is active, Juggernaut still counts as valid unit for these abilities:
** {{A|Keeper of the Light|Recall}}
** {{A|Dawnbreaker|Solar Guardian}}
** {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Invoker|Sun Strike|text=Cataclysm}}
** {{A|Tinker|Keen Conveyance}}
** {{A|Spectre|Haunt}}
** {{A|Town Portal Scroll|Teleport}}

* This ability does not interrupt the following abilities:
** {{A|Death Prophet|Spirit Siphon}}
** {{A|Io|Tether}}
** {{A|Razor|Static Link}}

* These abilities can teleport the Juggernaut during Omnislash:
** {{A|Io|Relocate}}
** {{A|Keeper of the Light|Recall}}
** {{A|Pudge|Meat Hook}} if Juggernaut used ult during pull

